5,1,1,talk,Servas,,Let us begin. I wish to understand our reporting burdens. I will look into independent checks on holdings' reported figures and appraisal needs at the last audit.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I agree we need clarity. I will examine account retention through price rises and the profile of the exits and the write-off.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I am concerned about our long-term liquidity. I'll check reserve accounts and follow-on calls, as well as the terms of last winter's credit line.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,I want to see if we can actually find the people these companies need! I'll take retained recruiters' placement times and adviser bench and partner board seats.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I will look into the security review time before first deployment and the delivery records of two holdings.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
