25,2,1,talk,Servas,,"It seems physical assets complicate our audits and reporting. Software is cleaner, though perhaps less transparent in its raw data.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"My findings suggest that back-office financial tools have been our most successful exits, and certain niches show better price resilience.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,Minako,,"We are spending reserves faster than planned. Furthermore, our credit line is useless for subscription-based security.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Mio,,"We have plenty of software board capacity, but finding operational staff or field crews is a nightmare.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Toshio,,Hardware and medical data cause significant delays. Software integrated into existing bank cycles seems far more reliable for deployment.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Servas,,"That is a sobering thought, Mio. If we cannot staff the operation, the investment is a gamble.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"If we prioritize the financial tools Toshio mentioned, we align with our most profitable exit profiles.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,Minako,,"We must be careful. If the company requires heavy follow-on capital for equipment, our current reserves cannot sustain it.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Mio,,"So we should avoid anything that needs a ""field crew,"" right?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Toshio,,Precisely. And we should avoid anything that triggers a three-quarter security review.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,talk,Servas,,I am leaning away from anything requiring outside appraisals. It adds too much cost and time to our quarter-end.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"I agree. The data suggests a preference for high-retention, low-overhead software.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,Minako,,"I will support a candidate that doesn't demand immediate, heavy capital calls for physical infrastructure.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,Mio,,I'm just worried about the partners' board seats. We are already stretched thin on software.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"Quality over quantity, Mio. A fast deployment is better than a vacant board seat.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,4,talk,Servas,,We have a clear picture of the risks. Let us see the candidates.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,4,talk,Asuka,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,4,talk,Minako,,I am ready.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,4,talk,Mio,,Me too!,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,4,talk,Toshio,,Let's proceed.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
