50,3,1,talk,Servas,,"We have Clinic Scheduler, Harvest Sensor, Fabric Loop, and Ledger Bridge. Ledger Bridge seems the most compatible with our reporting needs.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"Ledger Bridge fits the profile of our successful exits perfectly. Clinic Scheduler also has good retention, but the security review is a risk.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,Minako,,Harvest Sensor and Fabric Loop sound capital-intensive. Ledger Bridge is the safest for our reserves.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Mio,,"Ledger Bridge is software, so we have the board seats, and it doesn't need field crews like Harvest Sensor or Fabric Loop!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Ledger Bridge avoids the security delays of medical records and the hardware shortages of sensors. It is the logical choice.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Servas,,Is there any reason to consider the others? Fabric Loop's logistics seem a nightmare for our current recruiters.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"Harvest Sensor has retention, but the appraisal costs Servas mentioned would be a burden.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,Minako,,I cannot support Fabric Loop; the write-off profile for premises-based businesses is too risky.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,Mio,,I'm all for Ledger Bridge! It's the easiest to support.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Toshio,,I see no reason to deviate. Ledger Bridge is the most efficient path to deployment.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,3,talk,Servas,,I am satisfied. The alignment here is rare.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,3,talk,Asuka,,I agree.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,3,talk,Minako,,I agree.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,3,talk,Mio,,Yay!,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,3,talk,Toshio,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
